<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Gucci Group to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/2 to 66-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
